This package adapts material from pi-system-prompt-viewer:

  Project: pi-system-prompt-viewer
  Author:  eggmasonvalue
  URL:     https://github.com/eggmasonvalue/pi-system-prompt-viewer
  Licence: Apache-2.0

Material changes made from upstream:

- Ported only the provider-neutral System Footprint view. The Provider Request
  view and the `before_provider_request` subscription were removed, so no
  provider payload is rendered or serialised.
- Reduced the upstream two-view TUI overlay to a single system-footprint view;
  the tab toggle was removed.
- Integrated the viewer with this package's SDK dump script, so the assembled
  prompt for another project directory can be captured to a file from both the
  `/system-context` command and a model-callable tool.
